**/dist-types
# TypeScript's incremental cache. A stale one makes `tsc -b` skip emitting
# entirely, producing an image whose client bundle cannot resolve the shared
# package. `*.tsbuildinfo` alone only matches the context root.
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.github
docs
*.log
.env
.env.local
